<title>POLAND: Polish Impexmetal wants bourse debut June 24.</title>
<headline>Polish Impexmetal wants bourse debut June 24.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish metals trader Impexmetal SA wants to start bourse trade on the main market on June 24, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>In May the Polish state treasury sold 2,994,142 shares of Impexmetal at 36 zlotys each. An earlier public offering of 3,189,171 new Impexmetal shares also at 36 zlotys was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
